  scope: 'live Mass regression + inline rubrical certification',
  repairs: [
    'Inline cue locator now reaches dialogue rows, fixing Adjutorium and Indulgentiam exact anchoring.',
    'Ordinary Gospel announcement now derives Matthew/Mark/Luke/John from the resolved Proper instead of hard-coding Luke.',
